        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "When a Refugee Desperado appears, any ongoing duel ends immediately. Both participants return to the train with their original inventories; no win, loss, or defeat allowance is counted. Living Roulette Devils must spectate until the Desperado dies and the phase ends, then revive; no new duels can start during this phase. Devils already dead before the phase do not revive because of it.",
            "zh_cn": "对手初始生命为3，你为4；每次操作限时固定17秒，超时将自动向自己开枪。每次补给先从2–5件中抽取，再乘70%得到1–4件；仅初始补给在缩减后每人再减1件（最低为0），因此对手初始0–3件，你保留额外1件的初始奖励、初始为1–4件。",
            "zh_tw": "对手初始生命为3，你为4；每次操作限时固定17秒，超时将自动向自己开枪。每次补给先从2–5件中抽取，再乘70%得到1–4件；仅初始补给在缩减后每人再减1件（最低为0），因此对手初始0–3件，你保留额外1件的初始奖励、初始为1–4件。"
          },
          "point": [
            4.0,
            1.8,
            3.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
