            "en_us": "In your inventory, click the portrait of a low-sanity player or a player marked by your mature seed to bring both of you to a secret dark room and sit for a duel. The same target cannot be challenged again until 60 seconds after your previous duel with them ends. Neither participant can leave the seat or be teleported away before it ends; the duel also ends if the game ends or either participant dies from another cause. Targets inside another domain or shielded by domain sanctuary cannot be challenged. If your opponent has a sanity meter, it is temporarily filled to their current mood's maximum and immune to natural sanity drain during the duel; leaving or cancelling restores their original sanity and natural-drain immunity.",
