        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "You are invulnerable at all times; only the final defeat settlement of a roulette duel can truly kill you, and forced deaths from the train or other external causes have no effect. You possess killer instinct: every player appears to you as the same blue outline, and only those whose sanity is strictly below 30%, or who carry your mature seed, can be challenged. You are a cloud of black smoke, normally visible only to low-sanity players, but your duel opponent can always see you. You cannot pick up dropped items or collide with other players; gun rays pass through you, and skills cannot target you.",
            "zh_cn": "你常态处于无敌状态，只有轮盘赌局最终的败局结算能真正令你死亡。",
            "zh_tw": "技能1·惡魔種子：瞄準8格內可見的玩家種下種子，不限陣營，30秒後成熟。成熟時你會收到提示，目標也會收到醒目提醒和聲音。冷卻90秒。"
